459 - As the Bridegroom to His Chosen
 / 
Key: F
Time: 4/4
Tempo: Moderato
Number: 459
Topic: Christian Life - 

Verse 1:
[F]As the [Am]bridegroom [Gm]to [C]his chosen,
[Dm/A]As [Gm]the king to [Bb]his [Gm]realm,
[Am]As [Dm]the [Am/E]keep unto [Gm]the castle,
[C]As [Edim]the [F]pilot [C7]to the [F]helm,
[F]So, Lord, art Thou to me.

Verse 2:
[F]As the [Am]fountain [Gm]in [C]the garden,
[Dm/A]As [Gm]the candle [Bb]in the [Gm]dark,
[Am]As [Dm]the [Am/E]treasure [Gm]in the coffer,
[C]As [Edim]the [F]manna [C7]in the [F]ark,
[F]So, Lord, art Thou to me.

Verse 3:
[F]As the [Am]ruby [Gm]in [C]the setting,
[Dm/A]As [Gm]the honey [Bb]in the [Gm]comb,
[Am]As [Dm]the [Am/E]light within [Gm]the lantern,
[C]As [Edim]the [F]father [C7]in the [F]home,
[F]So, Lord, art Thou to me.

Verse 4:
[F]As the [Am]sunshine [Gm]in [C]the heavens,
[Dm/A]As [Gm]the image [Bb]in the [Gm]glass,
[Am]As [Dm]the [Am/E]fruits up [Gm]in the fig [C]tree,
[C]As [Edim]the [F]dew [Bb]upon [C7/Bb]the [F]grass,
[F]So, Lord, art Thou to me.
